            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Następnie możemy dodać w nawiasach wartości, które chcemy ustawić dla nowego obiektu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leo Tolstoy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;War and Peace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(book1);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Book { author: 'Leo Tolstoy', title: 'War and Peace' }\" /></content></output></code><p /></body></html>",
